{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836620/extras/09257ac7a024dc63ece14152831c5234.avif?t=1756908746\" width=616 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a life guard. Or maybe not. <br>You are the waterpark's janitor outside opening hours. Or maybe not. <br>You are a waterslide technician inspecting safety. Or maybe not. <br>You are an investigator sent to look for missing people. Or maybe not. <br>You are alone ... or maybe not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836620/extras/32f47c937b67921bf046f10e6009493d.poster.avif?t=1756908746\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836620/extras/32f47c937b67921bf046f10e6009493d.webm?t=1756908746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836620/extras/32f47c937b67921bf046f10e6009493d.mp4?t=1756908746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836620/extras/8b291b57e934569ad19d6158e1f899f6.avif?t=1756908746\" width=616 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>In Journey To The Center Of The Lost Waterpark you discover why you are there and who you are. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your skills and your way of thinking will be put to the test in a waterpark scenery that is not what it seems to be - welcoming you with liminality and symmetry.  <br>  <br>Dark corridors, beautifully bright rooms, claustrophobic hallways, hidden passages and intense waterslide riding await you on the illusive journey of this uncharted realm, where every step draws you deeper into its secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you able to reveal your purpose and the existence of the Lost Waterpark?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836620/extras/eb862851827519e925f96444cf048dc8.poster.avif?t=1756908746\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836620/extras/eb862851827519e925f96444cf048dc8.webm?t=1756908746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836620/extras/eb862851827519e925f96444cf048dc8.mp4?t=1756908746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836620/extras/b0e853e81c5e2a2feee0fea5c6c04565.avif?t=1756908746\" width=616 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>This Demo contains</u>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 unique level of\u00a0<strong>1st person experience</strong> which is a separate gameplay experience compared to the full version</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Showcasing:</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; Collect Gems to solve <strong>Puzzle Areas</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; Complex <strong>Maze</strong> Structures that may behold secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; Turn\u00a0<strong>Physics Based</strong> Swim Rings, Beach Balls and more into your water toys</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; Otherworldly <strong>Platforming</strong> Trials</p